{"id":"ac4388db49632759","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-pr-equal-tm.md","title":"PR Is a Proper Subclass of Total Turing-Computable Functions","display":"prop-pr-equal-tm — PR Is a Proper Subclass of Total Turing-Computable Functions","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-pr-equal-tm","aliases":["92-prop-pr-equal-tm"],"display":"prop-pr-equal-tm — PR Is a Proper Subclass of Total Turing-Computable Functions","depends_on":["[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[92-df-recursive-function]]","[[92-ex-ackermann-not-pr]]","[[92-prop-rec-equal-tm]]"],"source":"本地递归论补充；原书第 IV 章 p. 48 仅提及 primitive recursive","source_status":"原书之外的严格子类比较"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-pr-equal-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-pr-equal-tm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-pr-equal-tm — PR Is a Proper Subclass of Total Turing-Computable Functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a7ed5215db80540\" href=\"?note=0a7ed5215db80540\" title=\"92-ex-ackermann-not-pr\">92-ex-ackermann-not-pr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e09695d13f301942\" href=\"?note=e09695d13f301942\" title=\"92-prop-rec-equal-tm\">92-prop-rec-equal-tm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地递归论补充；原书第 IV 章 p. 48 仅提及 primitive recursive"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书之外的严格子类比较"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TMComp}\">\\(\\mathrm{TMComp}\\)</span> (Turing-computable partial-function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ack}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ack}\\)</span> (total Ackermann function)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}pr\\text{-}equal\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n(f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{TMComp}(f))\\Bigr]\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{TMComp}(\\mathrm{Ack})\\land\\mathrm{Ack}\\notin\\mathrm{PR}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}pr\\text{-}equal\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n(f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{TMComp}(f))\\Bigr]\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{TMComp}(\\mathrm{Ack})\\land\\mathrm{Ack}\\notin\\mathrm{PR}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PR函数是Turing可计算的（PR ⊆ TM）</li>\n<li>但存在TM可计算函数非PR</li>\n<li>例：Ackermann函数是TM可计算但非PR</li>\n<li>在全函数中，原始递归函数是真包含于 Turing 可计算函数的子类</li>\n<li>全递归函数与全Turing可计算函数相同；原始递归函数只是其中真子类</li>\n<li>Church–Turing 论题讨论非形式的有效可计算性；本条 PR 与 TM 的形式子类关系不依赖该论题</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这里 TMComp 在总函数上使用与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e09695d13f301942\" href=\"?note=e09695d13f301942\" title=\"92-prop-rec-equal-tm\">92-prop-rec-equal-tm</a> 同一固定机器模型。PR⊆Rec 后由该模型等价得到 PR⊆TM；Ack 的可计算性与非 PR 需要 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a7ed5215db80540\" href=\"?note=0a7ed5215db80540\" title=\"92-ex-ackermann-not-pr\">92-ex-ackermann-not-pr</a> 的独立论证。原书未展开 Ackermann 比较，不把这一例当作其章节结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ex-ackermann-not-pr","status":"resolved","id":"0a7ed5215db80540","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ex-ackermann-not-pr]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-prop-rec-equal-tm","status":"resolved","id":"e09695d13f301942","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-prop-rec-equal-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-prop-rec-equal-tm","status":"resolved","id":"e09695d13f301942","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"这里 TMComp 在总函数上使用与 [[92-prop-rec-equal-tm]] 同一固定机器模型。PR⊆Rec 后由该模型等价得到 PR⊆TM；Ack 的可计算性与非 PR 需要 [[92-ex-ackermann-not-pr]] 的独立论证。原书未展开 Ackermann 比较，不把这一例当作其章节结论。","embed":false},{"target":"92-ex-ackermann-not-pr","status":"resolved","id":"0a7ed5215db80540","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"这里 TMComp 在总函数上使用与 [[92-prop-rec-equal-tm]] 同一固定机器模型。PR⊆Rec 后由该模型等价得到 PR⊆TM；Ack 的可计算性与非 PR 需要 [[92-ex-ackermann-not-pr]] 的独立论证。原书未展开 Ackermann 比较，不把这一例当作其章节结论。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TMComp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ack}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}pr\\text{-}equal\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n(f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{TMComp}(f))\\Bigr]\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{TMComp}(\\mathrm{Ack})\\land\\mathrm{Ack}\\notin\\mathrm{PR}\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1815,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-345","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-prop-pr-equal-tm]]"}],"outgoing":["8bff810dd710385a","d65795dc15ebce4b","0a7ed5215db80540","e09695d13f301942"]}